<title>TANZANIA: Tanzania shilling steady on dollar, up on pound.</title>
<headline>Tanzania shilling steady on dollar, up on pound.</headline>
<dateline>DAR ES SALAAM 1997-07-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Tanzanian shilling was unchanged against the dollar on Thursday continuing a one-week trend, but gained on the pound, the central bank said.</p>
<p>The shilling exchanged at a commercial mean rate of 624.6900 unchanged since last Wednesday. Against the pound the shilling exchanged at mean rate 1053.4179 from 1053.6974 on Wednesday, the Bank of Tanzania said.</p>
</text>
